@startuml
[*] --> EvaluatingRoot : interpret(context)
EvaluatingRoot --> EvaluatingLeft : composite evaluates left operand
EvaluatingLeft --> EvaluatingRight : left value returned
EvaluatingRight --> ResultComputed : right value returned
ResultComputed --> [*] : double returned to caller
note top of EvaluatingRoot
  Terminal expressions (NumberExpression,
  VariableExpression) have no children:
  they go straight to ResultComputed.
  DivideExpression also throws
  ArithmeticException on a zero divisor.
end note
@enduml
